#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STM32WL Series Chip Variant Selection
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines chip variants for STM32WL series.
# TODO: Add specific chip variants (WL54, WL55, WLE4, WLE5)
